.TH LISTXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
listxattr \- lists nul-separated attribute names by path, following symbolic links
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B ssize_t listxattr(const char* path, char* list, size_t size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists NUL-separated attribute names by path, following symbolic links. A zero size queries the required length.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR listxattr (2)
